  "name": "E38 · catalogue · 145.6M (124.9M core)",
  "description": "E38 arm catalogue_reuse_n4 — catalogue, 150M leaderboard size (m120t); Hub id catalogue-150m-11.5bt (planned; not released). New against e33t_catalogue_reuse_n4_s30: the catalogue with re-opening, 64 notes per 256-token page (4 tokens per note), at the 150M leaderboard size (m120t): 13 layers (2 more stacked), FFN 2,816, the SmolLM2 vocabulary (49,152), the output tied to the input table through one 896 → 384 projection; no m100 catalogue was drawn, so the parent is the same arm at 30M. Protocol (E38 leaderboard recipe): 11.5B tokens of m21mix_v2 (SmolLM2 tokens): 8.0B in rows of 4,096, then 3.0B at 16,384, then 0.5B at 65,536; 128 rows of 4k per step (32 of 16k, 8 of 64k); Muon from one peak (0.01; the 64k phase at a tenth) with AdamW; one 4 × L40S AWS node per model. Trunk (as the trainer builds m120t): L0–L2 local (window 128), L3 the reading layer, L4 local; [L3, L4] run 4 times with shared weights and a per-round embedding; then L5–L12 local; RoPE θ 500k except on L7 and L11 (every 4th stacked layer); U-net skips L5→L7, L4→L8, L3→L9, L2→L10, L1→L11, L0→L12 (one scalar each, zero at the start); 14 query heads × 64, 1 key/value head, QK norm; SwiGLU 2,816; logits = (h·Pᵀ)·Eᵀ with P [384 × 896] the head's only weights (0.34M instead of an untied head's 44M), softcap 30, z-loss 1e-4. Built 2026-11-21; status done (as of 2026-11-21). Finished training 2026-11-20 05:47 UTC; its model card is being written; not released yet. Writer: 256-token pages without overlap, 64 notes per page, width 256, 2 page layers, notes 512 wide with 8 heads, 2 rounds; 4,100,544 weights (memory_writer) + 513 in the reading layer (4 empty slots and the index temperature). Spec: docs/experiments_specs/ahead/E38_long_budget_mix.md. Source: origin/dev @ 99d808a7. Not a builder field: As the catalogue with re-opening: balanced filing, the index loss and the re-opening switch have no weights or builder field. The slot count changes the writer's learned slots and its position prior (slots × 8 heads × page length). The run setup shows 4 × H100 (the builder has no L40S preset) and one optimizer, Muon (the trainer pairs Muon with AdamW). The phase lengths 16k and 64k are not part of the run setup (it shows the 4k phase). Parameters: 145,607,265 in total, 124,896,993 without the word tables (input embedding 20,366,208 + output layer 344,064); exact against the trainer's own count (scripts/run_e33n.py count() on fit(\"catalogue_reuse_n4\", \"m120t\") — FFN 2816 as set, the trainer's factory on the meta device with the SmolLM2 vocabulary of 49,152: the total with non_embedding=False, the core is count()'s default; the tied table is counted once, in the input embedding).",
